    },
    {
      "text": "it's how you keep your CTO from blowing away your agentic experience by accident one morning. True story, happened to a founder friend of mine.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1697,
      "why": "Makes the case for regression evals with a concrete failure mode."
    },
    {
      "text": "I challenge you to go home today and take a look at what you're sending to LLM's and ask yourself, is this something that a smaller model could handle and how much money would I save if I did that?",
      "timestamp_sec": 1697,
